# One line away from aa-counter-guard: the reserve posts at the frontier
# extractor instead of the base. Six batches agree matches are decided by
# extractor drops 688-1,766 units from where the army stands; the corpus
# ranks forward posture second of everything it teaches. This arm moves the
# army to where the match is decided ([[policy-holding-ground]],
# [[community-play-strategies]]).

name aa-counter-guard-fwd
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 1
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
